#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_resident.py:0
msgid ""
"Le départ de %(who)s est confirmé (clés remises le %(date)s), mais le "
"dossier la désigne encore comme occupante. Ses accès ne seront pas réémis. "
"Mettez le dossier à jour (bail, registre), ou déclarez un retour à la main."
msgstr ""
"The departure of %(who)s is confirmed (keys handed back on %(date)s), but "
"the file still names them as an occupant. Their access will not be reissued."
" Update the file (lease, register), or declare a return by hand."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_resident__stale_source_noted
msgid ""
"Le départ est confirmé, mais le dossier désigne encore la personne comme "
"occupante (p. ex. cotitulaire resté au bail). Les accès ne sont pas réémis :"
" un retour se déclare à la main."
msgstr ""
"The departure is confirmed, but the file still names the person as an "
"occupant (e.g. a co-lessee still on the lease). Access is not reissued: a "
"return is declared by hand."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_departure__date_keys
msgid ""
"Le jour où la personne a rendu les clés ou quitté les lieux, constaté. Pas "
"une date prévue."
msgstr ""
"The day the person handed back the keys or left the premises, as observed. "
"Not a planned date."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_pass__tenant_agreed_outside_hours
msgid ""
"Le locataire peut refuser avant 9 h ou après 21 h (visite, vérification) et "
"avant 7 h ou après 19 h (travaux) : son accord se consigne."
msgstr ""
"The lessee may refuse before 9 a.m. or after 9 p.m. (visit, inspection) and "
"before 7 a.m. or after 7 p.m. (work): their agreement is recorded."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_pass.py:0
msgid ""
"Le locataire peut refuser cette entrée hors de %(first)d h à %(last)d h, "
"heure de l'immeuble (art. %(article)s C.c.Q.) : consignez son accord, ou "
"changez la plage."
msgstr ""
"The lessee may refuse this entry outside %(first)d:00 to %(last)d:00, "
"building time (art. %(article)s CCQ): record their agreement, or change the "
"window."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_pass__accompanied_by
msgid ""
"Le locataire peut refuser une visite si le locateur ou son représentant ne "
"peut être présent (art. 1932 al. 2)."
msgstr ""
"The lessee may refuse a visit if the lessor or their representative cannot "
"be present (art. 1932 para. 2)."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_pass.py:0
msgid ""
"Le logement n'est pas inoccupé : quelqu'un y réside. Choisissez le motif de "
"l'entrée."
msgstr ""
"The dwelling is not vacant: someone lives there. Choose the reason for "
"entry."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_pass__holder_name
msgid "Le nom suffit : un visiteur n'a rien consenti, et la trace se purge."
msgstr ""
"The name is enough: a visitor has consented to nothing, and the record is "
"purged."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_pass.py:0
msgid "Le préavis se consigne une fois donné, pas d'avance."
msgstr "Notice is recorded once it has been given, not in advance."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_order.py:0
msgid "Le rappel de cet ordre avait été supprimé sans que l'ordre soit fait."
msgstr "This order's reminder had been deleted without the order being done."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_grant.py:0
msgid ""
"Le support d'un droit émis ne change pas : retirez-le et émettez-en un "
"autre."
msgstr ""
"The credential of an issued access right does not change: remove it and "
"issue another."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_grant.py:0
msgid "Le titulaire n'est plus présent."
msgstr "The holder is no longer present."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access.view_bf_property_access_departure_form
msgid ""
"Les accès de ces personnes seront retirés : un ordre de retrait par\n"
"                    droit, aux appareils ou au responsable de chaque point. Les autres\n"
"                    occupants du logement gardent les leurs."
msgstr ""
"These people's access will be removed: one removal order per\n"
"                    access right, to the devices or to the person responsible for each point. The other\n"
"                    occupants of the dwelling keep theirs."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_access.view_access_resident_form
msgid ""
"Les accès restent en place : ils ne seront retirés qu'une fois la date des clés\n"
"                        remises saisie. Le bail se reconduit de plein droit (art. 1941 C.c.Q.) et seul le\n"
"                        tribunal expulse qui reste dans les lieux (art. 1889)."
msgstr ""
"Access stays in place: it will be removed only once the date the keys\n"
"                        were handed back is entered. The lease is renewed by operation of law (art. 1941 CCQ) and only the\n"
"                        court can evict a person who remains in the premises (art. 1889)."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_access/models/bf_property_access_resident.py:0
msgid "Les clés ne peuvent pas être remises avant l'arrivée."
msgstr "Keys cannot be handed back before the arrival."

