"               occupants, signataires de bail) chaque nuit, ou du bouton « Synchroniser avec le\n"
"               dossier ». Un conjoint ou un enfant majeur qui n'a rien signé se déclare ici."
msgstr ""
"Residents come from the file (co-owners occupying their fraction,\n"
"               occupants, lease signatories) every night, or from the \"Sync with the\n"
"               file\" button. A spouse or adult child who has signed nothing is declared here."

