"Un résident qui a déjà des droits ne change ni de personne ni de logement : "
"confirmez son départ et créez-en un autre."
msgstr ""
"A resident who already has access rights changes neither person nor "
"dwelling: confirm their departure and create another one."

#. module: bf_property_access
#. odoo-python
