msgstr "Empty: each order becomes an activity for the person responsible."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_point__unit_id
msgid ""
"Vide : le point sert tout l'immeuble (entrée, garage, colis). Rempli : il ne"
" sert que les résidents de cette fraction (porte du logement, casier "
"attitré)."
msgstr ""
"Empty: the point serves the whole immovable (entrance, garage, parcels). "
"Filled in: it serves only the residents of this fraction (unit door, "
"assigned locker)."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_resident__unit_id
msgid ""
"Vide pour une chambre ou un bail sans fraction inscrite : la personne n'a "
"alors que les points communs de l'immeuble."
msgstr ""
"Empty for a room or a lease with no registered fraction: the person then has"
" only the common access points of the immovable."

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_property_access.selection__bf_property_access_pass__entry_reason__showing_buyer
msgid "Visite d'un acquéreur éventuel"
msgstr "Showing to a prospective buyer"

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_property_access.selection__bf_property_access_pass__entry_reason__showing_tenant
msgid "Visite d'un locataire éventuel"
msgstr "Showing to a prospective lessee"

#. module: bf_property_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_access.field_bf_property_access_pass__tenant_notice_received_on
msgid ""
"Visite d'un locataire éventuel sans préavis : seulement après que le "
"locataire a avisé qu'il ne reconduit pas son bail ou le résilie (art. "
"1930-1931 C.c.Q.). Sans cette date, le préavis de 24 h s'applique."
msgstr ""
"Showing to a prospective lessee without notice: only after the lessee has "
"given notice that they will not renew their lease or that they are "
"resiliating it (art. 1930-1931 CCQ). Without this date, 24 hours' notice "
"applies."

